
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Akım Tesisat – Sulama ve Mekanik Tesisat Çözümleri</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;600;700&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --white: #ffffff;
    --off-white: #f8f7f5;
    --light: #f0ede8;
    --mid: #e0dbd4;
    --border: #d4cfc8;
    --text-dark: #1a1814;
    --text-mid: #4a4640;
    --text-light: #8a8480;
    --copper: #b87333;
    --copper-light: #d4924a;
    --copper-pale: #f5ede4;
    --blue-accent: #2a5fa5;
    --shadow-sm: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
    --shadow-md: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.10);
    --shadow-lg: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
  }

  * { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }

  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

  body {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    background: var(--white);
    color: var(--text-dark);
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  /* NAV */
  nav {
    position: fixed; top:40px; left:0; right:0; z-index:100;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.92);
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 0 48px;
    height: 68px;
    transition: box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }
  nav.scrolled { box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }
  .nav-logo {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .nav-logo img {
    height: 48px; width: 48px; object-fit: contain;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .nav-brand {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column;
  }
  .nav-brand-name {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--text-dark); letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .nav-brand-sub {
    font-size: 10px; font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--text-light); letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .nav-links {
    display: flex; gap: 36px; list-style: none;
  }
  .nav-links a {
    font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-mid);
    text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    transition: color 0.2s;
    position: relative;
  }
  .nav-links a::after {
    content:''; position:absolute; bottom:-4px; left:0; right:0;
    height:1.5px; background: var(--copper); transform: scaleX(0);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }
  .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--copper); }
  .nav-links a:hover::after { transform: scaleX(1); }
  .nav-cta {
    background: var(--text-dark); color: var(--white);
    padding: 10px 22px; border-radius: 100px;
    font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.1s;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .nav-cta:hover { background: var(--copper); transform: translateY(-1px); }

  /* HERO */
  .hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--white) 0%, var(--off-white) 40%, var(--copper-pale) 100%);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    padding: 120px 48px 60px;
    position: relative; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero::before {
    content:'';
    position:absolute; top:-200px; right:-200px;
    width:700px; height:700px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(184,115,51,0.08) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .hero::after {
    content:'';
    position:absolute; bottom:-100px; left:-100px;
    width:500px; height:500px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(42,95,165,0.05) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .hero-inner {
    max-width: 1200px; width:100%;
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 80px; align-items: center;
  }
  .hero-text { position: relative; z-index:2; }
  .hero-eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--copper);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .hero-eyebrow span {
    width: 28px; height: 1.5px; background: var(--copper); display:inline-block;
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: clamp(42px, 5vw, 68px);
    font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  h1 em {
    font-style: normal; color: var(--copper);
  }
  .hero-desc {
    font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-mid); max-width: 460px;
    margin-bottom: 40px; font-weight: 300;
  }
  .hero-actions {
    display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--text-dark); color: var(--white);
    padding: 15px 32px; border-radius: 100px;
    font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    transition: all 0.2s; display:inline-block;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--copper); transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }
  .btn-secondary {
    background: transparent; color: var(--text-dark);
    padding: 15px 32px; border-radius: 100px;
    font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    transition: all 0.2s; display:inline-block;
  }
  .btn-secondary:hover { border-color: var(--copper); color: var(--copper); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .hero-visual {
    display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;
    position: relative; z-index:2;
  }
  .hero-logo-wrap {
    width: 380px; height: 380px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    background: var(--white);
    border-radius: 50%;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg), 0 0 0 1px rgba(184,115,51,0.12);
    animation: float 6s ease-in-out infinite;
    padding: 32px;
  }
  .hero-logo-wrap img { width:100%; height:100%; object-fit: contain; }
  @keyframes float {
    0%,100% { transform: translateY(0); }
    50% { transform: translateY(-12px); }
  }

  /* SERVICES STRIP */
  .services-strip {
    background: var(--text-dark);
    padding: 0 48px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .services-inner {
    max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    border-left: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
  }
  .service-item {
    padding: 36px 28px;
    border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    position: relative;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }
  .service-item:hover { background: rgba(184,115,51,0.12); }
  .service-icon {
    font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 12px; display:block;
  }
  .service-title {
    font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .service-desc {
    font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45); line-height: 1.5;
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  /* ABOUT / TABELA */
  .about {
    padding: 100px 48px;
    background: var(--white);
  }
  .section-inner { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .section-label {
    font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--copper);
    margin-bottom: 16px; display:block;
  }
  h2 {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: clamp(32px, 3.5vw, 48px);
    font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--text-dark); line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .about-grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 40px; align-items: start;
    margin-top: 56px;
  }
  .about-text p {
    font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-mid);
    margin-bottom: 20px; font-weight: 300;
  }
  .about-stats {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 36px;
  }
  .stat-card {
    background: var(--off-white); border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--border);
    transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
  }
  .stat-card:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }
  .stat-num {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 36px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--copper);
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .stat-label {
    font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-light); margin-top: 6px;
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; font-weight: 500;
  }
  .about-image {
    border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .about-image img { width:100%; display:block; }

  /* PRODUCTS */
  .products {
    padding: 100px 48px;
    background: var(--off-white);
  }
  .products-header {
    display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 56px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px;
  }
  .catalog-wrapper {
    background: var(--white);
    border-radius: 24px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 32px;
  }
  .catalog-wrapper img {
    width: 100%; display: block; border-radius: 12px;
  }

  /* HIZMETLER */
  .hizmetler {
    padding: 100px 48px;
    background: var(--white);
  }
  .hizmet-grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px; margin-top: 56px;
  }
  .hizmet-card {
    background: var(--off-white); border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 36px 28px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    transition: all 0.25s ease;
    position: relative; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hizmet-card::before {
    content:'';
    position:absolute; top:0; left:0; right:0; height:3px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--copper), var(--blue-accent));
    transform: scaleX(0); transform-origin: left;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }
  .hizmet-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); background: var(--white); }
  .hizmet-card:hover::before { transform: scaleX(1); }
  .hizmet-ico {
    font-size: 36px; margin-bottom: 16px; display:block;
  }
  .hizmet-title {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-dark); margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .hizmet-desc {
    font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-light); font-weight: 300;
  }

  /* CONTACT */
  .contact {
    padding: 100px 48px;
    background: var(--text-dark);
    position: relative; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .contact::before {
    content:'';
    position:absolute; top:-300px; left:-300px;
    width:700px; height:700px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(184,115,51,0.15) 0%, transparent 60%);
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .contact .section-label { color: var(--copper-light); }
  .contact h2 { color: var(--white); }
  .contact-grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 72px; align-items: start;
    margin-top: 56px;
  }
  .contact-info-left p {
    font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); font-weight: 300;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .contact-cards {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px;
  }
  .contact-card {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px 28px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .contact-card:hover {
    background: rgba(184,115,51,0.15);
    border-color: rgba(184,115,51,0.4);
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }
  .contact-card-ico {
    font-size: 28px; flex-shrink:0;
    width:52px; height:52px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius: 14px;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  }
  .contact-card-text { flex:1; }
  .contact-card-label {
    font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .contact-card-value {
    font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--white);
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }
  .contact-right {
    background: var(--white); border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 44px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
  }
  .contact-right h3 {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-dark);
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .owner-info {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px;
    padding: 24px; background: var(--copper-pale);
    border-radius: 16px; margin-bottom: 28px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(184,115,51,0.2);
  }
  .owner-avatar {
    width: 60px; height: 60px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--copper), var(--copper-light));
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    font-size: 24px; flex-shrink:0;
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-weight: 700; color: white;
  }
  .owner-name {
    font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-dark);
  }
  .owner-role {
    font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-light); margin-top: 2px;
  }
  .call-btn {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px;
    background: var(--text-dark); color: var(--white);
    padding: 18px 32px; border-radius: 14px; text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    transition: all 0.2s; margin-top: 24px; width:100%;
    border: none; cursor: pointer;
  }
  .call-btn:hover { background: var(--copper); transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }

  /* FOOTER */
  footer {
    background: #0e0d0b; padding: 36px 48px;
    display: flex; align-items:center; justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
  }
  .footer-left {
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px;
  }
  .footer-left img {
    height:40px; width:40px; object-fit:contain; border-radius:50%;
  }
  .footer-brand { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size:15px; color:var(--white); }
  .footer-copy { font-size:12px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.3); }

  /* DIVIDER */
  .divider {
    width:60px; height:2px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--copper), var(--blue-accent));
    margin: 20px 0 0;
  }

  /* ANIMATIONS */
  .fade-in {
    opacity:0; transform:translateY(20px);
    transition: opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease;
  }
  .fade-in.visible {
    opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    nav { padding: 0 24px; }
    .nav-links { display:none; }
    .hero { padding: 90px 24px 60px; }
    .hero-inner { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:40px; text-align:center; }
    .hero-logo-wrap { width:280px; height:280px; margin:0 auto; }
    .hero-desc { max-width:100%; }
    .hero-actions { justify-content:center; }
    .about, .products, .hizmetler, .contact { padding: 70px 24px; }
    .about-grid, .contact-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:40px; }
    .services-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .hizmet-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .services-strip { padding: 0 24px; }
    footer { padding: 28px 24px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- NAV -->
<div id="top-bar" style="background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1a1814 0%, #2a1f10 100%); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); text-align:center; padding: 11px 24px; font-size:13px; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:0.06em; text-transform:uppercase; font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif; border-bottom:2px solid #b87333; position:relative; z-index:101;">
  Tarımsal Sulama Sistemleri ve Mekanik Tesisat Çözümleri
</div>
<nav id="navbar">
  <a href="#" class="nav-logo">
    <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Akım Tesisat Logo">
    <div class="nav-brand">
      <span class="nav-brand-name">Akım Tesisat</span>
      <span class="nav-brand-sub">Sulama &amp; Mekanik Tesisat</span>
    </div>
  </a>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#hakkimizda">Hakkımızda</a></li>
    <li><a href="#urunler">Ürünler</a></li>
    <li><a href="#hizmetler">Hizmetler</a></li>
    <li><a href="#iletisim">İletişim</a></li>
  </ul>
  <a href="tel:05356196753" class="nav-cta">0535 619 67 53</a>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-text fade-in">
      <div class="hero-eyebrow"><span></span>Profesyonel Çözümler</div>
      <h1>Sulama &amp;<br><em>Mekanik Tesisat</em><br>Uzmanlığı</h1>
      <p class="hero-desc">Akım Tesisat olarak sulama sistemleri imalatı, tamiri ve mekanik tesisat alanlarında yıllarca kazanılan deneyimle profesyonel hizmet sunuyoruz.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="tel:05356196753" class="btn-primary">Hemen Ara</a>
        <a href="#urunler" class="btn-secondary">Ürünleri Gör</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-visual fade-in" style="transition-delay:0.2s">
      <div class="hero-logo-wrap">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Akım Tesisat">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SERVICES STRIP -->
<div class="services-strip">
  <div class="services-inner">
    <div class="service-item">
      <span class="service-icon">💧</span>
      <div class="service-title">Sulama Sistemleri</div>
      <div class="service-desc">Yeraltı ve yerüstü yağmurlama sistemleri imalatı ve tamiri</div>
    </div>
    <div class="service-item">
      <span class="service-icon">🔧</span>
      <div class="service-title">Mekanik Tesisat</div>
      <div class="service-desc">Flanş fittings, süzgeçli dip klepe ve tüm mekanik çözümler</div>
    </div>
    <div class="service-item">
      <span class="service-icon">🏗️</span>
      <div class="service-title">Kuyu Ekipmanları</div>
      <div class="service-desc">Sondaj tulumbası, santrafüj klepesi ve kuyu boruları</div>
    </div>
    <div class="service-item">
      <span class="service-icon">⚙️</span>
      <div class="service-title">Vana &amp; Bağlantı</div>
      <div class="service-desc">Küresel vana, klepe kaplin ve flanş contaları temin ve montajı</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- HAKKIMIZDA -->
<section class="about" id="hakkimizda">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <span class="section-label">Hakkımızda</span>
    <h2>Sucu Bekir olarak<br>tanınan güvenilir marka</h2>
    <div class="divider"></div>
    <div class="about-grid" style="grid-template-columns:1fr;">
      <div class="about-text fade-in">
        <p>Akım Tesisat, sulama malzemeleri ve mekanik tesisat alanında köklü deneyimiyle sektörde güvenilir bir referans noktası hâline gelmiştir. "Sucu Bekir" markasıyla tanınan firmamız, çiftçiden büyük projelere kadar geniş bir müşteri kitlesine hizmet vermektedir.</p>
        <p>Yeraltı ve yerüstü sulama sistemlerinden sondaj ekipmanlarına, flanş fittings'ten küresel vanaya kadar geniş ürün yelpazemizle tüm tesisat ihtiyaçlarınıza tek çatı altında cevap veriyoruz.</p>
        <div class="about-stats">
          <div class="stat-card">
            <div class="stat-num">20+</div>
            <div class="stat-label">Yıl Deneyim</div>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-card">
            <div class="stat-num">500+</div>
            <div class="stat-label">Tamamlanan Proje</div>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-card">
            <div class="stat-num">100%</div>
            <div class="stat-label">Müşteri Memnuniyeti</div>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-card">
            <div class="stat-num">16+</div>
            <div class="stat-label">Ürün Kategorisi</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ÜRÜNLER -->
<section class="products" id="urunler">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="products-header">
      <div>
        <span class="section-label">Ürün Kataloğu</span>
        <h2>Profesyonel Su Tesisatı<br>ve Kuyu Ekipmanları</h2>
        <div class="divider"></div>
      </div>
      <a href="tel:05356196753" class="btn-primary" style="align-self:flex-start">Fiyat Al →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="catalog-wrapper fade-in">
      <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Profesyonel Su Tesisatı ve Kuyu Ekipmanları Kataloğu">
